{"v":4,"catch":"≪月見糰子≫\n想在視野良好的地方吃糰子﹐對吧！","desc":"■遊戲概要\n不管在什麼地方吃的≪月見糰子≫都很好吃\n選一個能賞月的地方來吃糰子吧！\n用著奇妙的跳躍操作來挑戰看看最高峰吧！\n\n\n■故事\n兩個朋友來到兔子的身邊，給了兔子≪月見糰子≫。\n「難得的機會，怎麼不在高處邊賞月邊吃呢？」\n用兔子最得意的跳躍來出發前往最高峰吧！\n\n此遊戲是由Maker系列中專門製作動作遊戲的軟體「Pixel Game Maker MV」所製作。此遊戲系列均能在Nintendo Switch™上遊玩。","publisher":"Gotcha Gotcha Games","release":"2024-05-23","genres":["街機","動作","冒險"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d2fe54057e913582edc4956c3a226eaeee87fca02f83158d63dbbc2a5a2363c7.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/537113ce8d6db0efd99b97e8e69bb1761ae688da75333ceda957ef2718dd5888.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f84ca496fa50a8a03a4b3cfb3a095c31882fa1cac7c2283bc81799865000d9e7.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d0c484880f2b335f983050d4aa07847316e964951cc57175aefd01c92447cdd0.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/114a7feb981ce2731f5ea0c9426bc5d97a39ffa8e5dcb3e2cb193ed7f44ba5b4.jpg"],"titleId":"010039401efbe000","dlc":[]}